Jonquil ports and adapts DrClojure by Kim Taegyoon
(https://github.com/kimtg/DrClojure-Neo), distributed under the Eclipse
Public License 1.0. Code lifted from DrClojure keeps its original copyright,
and UPSTREAM.md lists which files it is in.

Jonquil's inspector view code (src/jonquil/inspect/view.clj) is lifted from
clojure-cli.repl (https://github.com/clojure/clojure-cli.repl), also
distributed under the Eclipse Public License 1.0. UPSTREAM.md records the
pinned commit and the changes.

Both were received under the Eclipse Public License 1.0. Jonquil distributes
them, with its own code, under the Eclipse Public License 2.0, as section 7 of
EPL-1.0 allows once a new version of the licence is published.

Jonquil's Parinfer engine (src/jonquil/parinfer.clj), lifted from DrClojure,
implements Parinfer v3.13.1 after parinfer.js
(https://github.com/parinfer/parinfer.js), and its test cases
(test-resources/parinfer/*.json) are parinfer.js's own. parinfer.js is
Copyright (c) 2015 Shaun Williams and contributors and distributed under the
MIT License, whose full text is in licenses/parinfer.js-LICENSE.md.
